    rdfs:comment 'Foreign key linking to genomics.genomic_consent. Business justification: Regulatory requirement (21 CFR Part 50): genomics trials require specific genomic data consent before enrollment. Research coordinators must verify genomic consent status as an enrollment gate for gen' ;
