    rdfs:comment 'Foreign key linking to research.deidentified_dataset. Business justification: Data access requests are for specific de-identified datasets. The dataset_name, dataset_description, and dataset_sensitivity_level on data_access_request are redundant with the deidentified_dataset ma' ;
